WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
Who are you and what do you do?

2
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:03,200
Master Liu, I have a feeling recently

3
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:06,470
Are you about to go out? Come in.

4
00:00:06,670 --> 00:00:07,870
Don’t you want to watch it with him?

5
00:00:08,070 --> 00:00:09,070
I don't look, you look

6
00:00:09,470 --> 00:00:11,470
This guy has no brains, but he has money

7
00:00:11,670 --> 00:00:14,070
If you let him out, he will definitely be cheated. You can also consider saving him.

8
00:00:19,110 --> 00:00:20,110
Show me first

9
00:00:20,310 --> 00:00:22,110
On my shoulders, Mr. Chen carried a hundred kilograms of cement.

10
00:00:22,310 --> 00:00:24,910
It’s not a fairy family, it’s two ghost spirits.

11
00:00:25,610 --> 00:00:27,210
What are you thinking about every day?

12
00:00:27,410 --> 00:00:28,810
Live a good life, okay?

13
00:00:29,010 --> 00:00:30,610
Who doesn’t know how to make money by taking action?

14
00:00:30,810 --> 00:00:31,810
No need to work every day

15
00:00:32,010 --> 00:00:34,210
Just lie down at home and read two hexagrams at random

16
00:00:34,210 --> 00:00:36,010
Just say a few words and you'll get the money.

17
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:40,750
So you want to go out just to make money, otherwise?

18
00:00:41,540 --> 00:00:42,940
Taking action is not as easy as you think

19
00:00:43,140 --> 00:00:44,940
You don't have that fate, little master

20
00:00:45,140 --> 00:00:47,140
If you don’t understand, ask Master Liu to come over.

21
00:00:50,180 --> 00:00:51,180
Are your shoulders still heavy?

22
00:00:53,370 --> 00:00:54,370
Much lighter

23
00:00:55,260 --> 00:00:57,260
Why did it sink again? I’ll tell you clearly.

24
00:00:57,460 --> 00:00:59,060
There are two heroic spirits lying on your shoulders.

25
00:00:59,260 --> 00:01:00,860
My wife and I have never spanked our children.

26
00:01:01,060 --> 00:01:03,590
What are they following me for? Six years ago

27
00:01:03,990 --> 00:01:07,190
Do you have a girlfriend who forces you to get married, but it doesn't work?

28
00:01:07,790 --> 00:01:09,190
She is pregnant and she has to force me to get married.

29
00:01:09,390 --> 00:01:11,790
It's impossible for me to get married again.

30
00:01:11,990 --> 00:01:13,390
Later I forced her to beat the child

31
00:01:13,590 --> 00:01:15,990
But I gave you tens of thousands in nutrition fees and you asked me to do whatever you want.

32
00:01:16,190 --> 00:01:18,190
What do they want from me? Are you shameless?

33
00:01:18,590 --> 00:01:20,190
Some families even went out to get broken shoes

34
00:01:20,390 --> 00:01:21,590
Do you think that’s all you need to pay?

35
00:01:21,790 --> 00:01:23,590
Those were two stillborn children.

36
00:01:23,790 --> 00:01:25,790
It's not an exaggeration to say that you killed someone.

37
00:01:25,990 --> 00:01:26,990
I gave money

38
00:01:27,190 --> 00:01:28,390
I paid for nutrition

39
00:01:28,590 --> 00:01:30,390
What happened if I asked her to spank two children?

40
00:01:31,300 --> 00:01:32,900
Get out of here with your dirty money

41
00:01:33,300 --> 00:01:34,900
What I despise the most is your kind of family red flag that never falls.

42
00:01:35,100 --> 00:01:38,900
The man who stepped on the flag and fluttered it outside was right.

43
00:01:39,100 --> 00:01:40,100
I bet you

44
00:01:40,700 --> 00:01:41,700
he will come back

45
00:01:42,100 --> 00:01:43,700
What else can a person like this bring back?
